{"id":"4b1f1864d7fb1f2e","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-use.md","title":"Oracle 计算的查询上界 use","display":"df-use — Oracle 计算的查询上界 use","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-use","aliases":["20-df-use"],"display":"df-use — Oracle 计算的查询上界 use","chapter":"3","section":"3.2–3.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 3.2.2(ii)；Remark 3.2.5；Theorem 3.3.9","source_printed_pages":[53,54,57],"source_pdf_pages":[89,90,93],"depends_on":["[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-use"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-use</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-use — Oracle 计算的查询上界 use"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.2–3.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.2.2(ii)；Remark 3.2.5；Theorem 3.3.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>53</span><span>54</span><span>57</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89</span><span>90</span><span>93</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x,u\\in\\omega\">\\(e,x,u\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_{e,q}\">\\(Q_{e,q}\\)</span> 是第 e 个 oracle 程序的查询状态集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是共同磁带字母表。use 只在相应计算正常停止时定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_{e,A,x}\">\\(Q_{e,A,x}\\)</span> 沿用停止历史并集的原接口。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"140cce30ee9c16d1\" href=\"?note=140cce30ee9c16d1\" title=\"20-df-oracle-numbering\">20-df-oracle-numbering</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}use}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c):=\\{n\\in\\omega:\n\\exists i&lt;|c|\\ \\exists q\\in Q_{e,q}\\ \\exists t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\n[c(i)=(q,t,h)\\land\\operatorname{num}(t,h)\\downarrow=n]\\},\\\\\nQ_{e,A,x}:=\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c):c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\\},\\\\\nu_e^A(x)\\downarrow=u\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ \\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\\land\nu=\\max(\\{n+1:n\\in\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c)\\}\\cup\\{0\\})],\\\\\nu_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=u\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow\\land u_e^{A_\\sigma}(x)\\downarrow=u,\\\\\nu_e^X(x)\\simeq u_e^{\\operatorname{set}(X)}(x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(u_e^A)=\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^A),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(u_e^\\sigma)=\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^\\sigma),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\uparrow\\Rightarrow Q_{e,A,x}=\\varnothing.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}use}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c):=\\{n\\in\\omega:\n\\exists i&lt;|c|\\ \\exists q\\in Q_{e,q}\\ \\exists t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\n[c(i)=(q,t,h)\\land\\operatorname{num}(t,h)\\downarrow=n]\\},\\\\\nQ_{e,A,x}:=\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c):c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\land\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\\},\\\\\nu_e^A(x)\\downarrow=u\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ \\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{&lt;\\omega}\\\n[\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\\land\nu=\\max(\\{n+1:n\\in\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c)\\}\\cup\\{0\\})],\\\\\nu_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=u\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow\\land u_e^{A_\\sigma}(x)\\downarrow=u,\\\\\nu_e^X(x)\\simeq u_e^{\\operatorname{set}(X)}(x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(u_e^A)=\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^A),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(u_e^\\sigma)=\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^\\sigma),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\uparrow\\Rightarrow Q_{e,A,x}=\\varnothing.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>查询集合通过实际译码输出收集，不再在未满足译码定义域条件的项上直接取值。在正常停止历史上，这与原查询集合完全相同。use 仍为最大查询数加一；没有查询时为 0，发散时未定义。Q 在发散时为空是原停止历史并集接口的结果，不是把无限运行中的真实查询集合改成空集。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.2.2(ii)；Remark 3.2.5；Theorem 3.3.9；印刷页 53, 54, 57；PDF 第 89, 90, 93 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-oracle-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-oracle-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"140cce30ee9c16d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-oracle-numbering]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"e,x,u\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"Q_{e,q}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"Q_{e,A,x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}use}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c):=\\{n\\in\\omega:\n\\exists i<|c|\\ \\exists q\\in Q_{e,q}\\ \\exists t\\in\\operatorname{Tape}_S\\ \\exists h\\in\\mathbb Z\\\n[c(i)=(q,t,h)\\land\\operatorname{num}(t,h)\\downarrow=n]\\},\\\\\nQ_{e,A,x}:=\\bigcup\\{\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c):c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{<\\omega}\\land\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ \\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\\},\\\\\nu_e^A(x)\\downarrow=u\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists y\\in\\omega\\ \\exists c\\in\\operatorname{Conf}_{M_e}^{<\\omega}\\\n[\\operatorname{Hist}(e,A,x,y,c)\\land\nu=\\max(\\{n+1:n\\in\\operatorname{Queries}_e(c)\\}\\cup\\{0\\})],\\\\\nu_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow=u\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\Phi_e^\\sigma(x)\\downarrow\\land u_e^{A_\\sigma}(x)\\downarrow=u,\\\\\nu_e^X(x)\\simeq u_e^{\\operatorname{set}(X)}(x),\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(u_e^A)=\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^A),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{dom}(u_e^\\sigma)=\\operatorname{dom}(\\Phi_e^\\sigma),\\\\\n\\Phi_e^A(x)\\uparrow\\Rightarrow Q_{e,A,x}=\\varnothing.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true}],"bytes":2429,"backlinks":[{"id":"24856bb9ed3c13f4","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-tred]]；see [[20-df-use]]。"},{"id":"18e11f4651f28406","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-use]]；see [[20-df-priority]]；see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"2e0d85a730fd3a26","anchor":"ref-5",